      "content": "Even in small doses, St. John's wort can have significant and unpredictable interactions with powerful medications like warfarin. Because these substances affect how your liver processes drugs, even a small amount could alter the effectiveness of your heart medication dangerously. For your safety, please insist on discussing specific supplement options or seeking a second opinion from your doctor or a pharmacist about managing your mood alongside your current treatment.",
