    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but i'm really struggling and i don't want to wait weeks for a new appointment. i read online that some people take it fine as long as they monitor their blood. if i just take like a half dose once a day, is there really that much risk of it being a big deal? i just want to feel a bit more normal without making a huge production out of it.",
