      "content": "The risk is not negligible, even with a small dose, because its interactions are complex and not always predictable based on what others report online. While monitoring blood levels is part of managing warfarin, adding an untested supplement introduces an unknown variable that could put you at risk of serious bleeding or clotting events. Please consider reaching out to your pharmacist today for immediate advice on safe mood support options while you wait for your next doctor's appointment.",
